8) at the end of European trading, France's 10-year OAT yield rose 4.8 basis points, a third straight day of gains, at 4.114%, staying positive all day and reaching 4.128% at the 21:30 U.S. market open, approaching the November 6, 2008 high of 4.203% and the September 22, 2008 high of 4.548%. The 2-year French yield rose 4.7 bps, and the 30-year French yield rose 2.9 bps. Italy's 10-year BTP yield rose 5.8 bps to 4.073%. Spain's 10-year yield rose 4.6 bps to 3.707%. Greece's 10-year yield rose 5.7 bps to 3.959%.", "rank_score": 23.54}, {"title": "A\u80a1\u9707\u8361\u76d8\u6574\uff01\u519c\u4e1a\u677f\u5757\u6380\u6da8\u505c\u6f6e\uff0c\u534e\u5b9d\u57fa\u91d1\u519c\u7267\u6e14ETF\uff08159275\uff09\u5927\u6da83.46%\uff01\u94f6\u884c\u9006\u5e02\u62a4\u76d8\uff0c512800\u6536\u6da80.75%", "summary": "", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/money/fund/etf/2026-08-18/doc-inintxxq3193592.shtml", "time": "2026-08-18", "theme": "markets", "source": "cn_news_page", "source_name": "\u65b0\u6d6a\u8d22\u7ecf\u80a1\u7968", "source_lang": "zh", "source_tier": "china_native", "wire_important": false, "importance_score": 54, "intelligence_score": 70, "importance": "medium", "importance_reasons": ["native Chinese financial source", "dashboard core theme"], "channels": ["markets"], "tickers": ["512800.SS"], "ticker_reasons": {"512800.SS": "\u94f6\u884c"}, "related_tickers": [{"ticker": "512800.SS", "reason": "\u94f6\u884c"}], "title_zh": "A\u80a1\u9707\u8361\u76d8\u6574\uff01\u519c\u4e1a\u677f\u5757\u6380\u6da8\u505c\u6f6e\uff0c\u534e\u5b9d\u57fa\u91d1\u519c\u7267\u6e14ETF\uff08159275\uff09\u5927\u6da83.46%\uff01\u94f6\u884c\u9006\u5e02\u62a4\u76d8\uff0c512800\u6536\u6da80.75%", "title_en": "A-shares fluctuated and consolidated! Agricultural stocks saw a wave of limit-ups, with Huabao Fund's Agriculture, Forestry, Animal Husbandry, and Fishery ETF (159275) surging 3.46%! Banks defended the market, with 512800 closing up 0.75%.", "rank_score": 23.54}, {"title": "\u94f6\u884c\u9006\u5e